:sup><jats:italic>p</jats:italic></jats:sup>‐version of the classical Korn's first inequality and for skew‐symmetric \n an <jats:italic>L</jats:italic><jats:sup><jats:italic>p</jats:italic></jats:sup>‐version of the Poincaré inequality.</jats:p>","DOI":"10.1002/mma.7498","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2021,5,12]],"date-time":"2021-05-12T04:45:42Z","timestamp":1620794742000},"page":"11392-11403","update-policy":"https://doi.org/10.1002/crossmark_policy","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":26,"title":["Nečas–Lions lemma revisited: An <i>L</i><sup><i>p</i></sup>‐version of the generalized Korn inequality for incompatible tensor fields"],"prefix":"10.1002","volume":"44","author":[{"ORCID":"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7188-4806","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Peter","family":"Lewintan","sequence":"first","affiliation":[{"name":"Faculty of Mathematics University of Duisburg‐Essen  Essen Germany"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1615-8879","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Patrizio","family":"Neff","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Faculty of Mathematics University of Duisburg‐Essen  Essen Germany"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"311","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2021,5,11]]},"reference":[{"key":"e_1_2_6_2_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016/j.jde.2014.10.019"},{"key":"e_1_2_6_3_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1002/cpa.10048"},{"key":"e_1_2_6_4_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1512/iumj.2016.65.5797"},{"key":"e_1_2_6_5_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1007/s00526-013-0641-5"},{"key":"e_1_2_6_6_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1051/cocv/2014068"},{"key":"e_1_2_6_7_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1512/iumj.2014.63.5330"},{"key":"e_1_2_6_8_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1002/mma.1534"},{"key":"e_1_2_6_9_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1007/s00